# Implementasi Fitur Crawl Engine — Sitemap & Recursive Crawler

## Tujuan
Mengimplementasikan modul **D. Crawl: Sitemap Mapping & Recursive Crawler** dari [scraping-engine-features.md](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/python-next-boilerplate/scraping-engine-features.md) secara lengkap dan premium. Fitur ini memungkinkan pengguna memetakan `sitemap.xml` dan merayap situs OPD secara periodik/rekursif dengan jeda (rate-limiting), anti-blocking, dan visualisasi progres di dashboard secara real-time.

---

## Proposed Architecture & Workflow

Fitur crawler ini akan dibangun berbasis **Event-Driven Workflow** menggunakan Inngest agar proses perayapan berdurasi panjang dapat berjalan dengan andal di latar belakang (background), tahan terhadap crash/restarter, dan memiliki checkpoint per halaman.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Admin UI
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Service as Crawler Service
    participant Inngest as Inngest Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (DB)

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/crawler/crawl (URL, depth, path_filter, limit)
    API->>Service: create_crawl_job()
    Service->>DB: Simpan status CrawlJob 'PENDING'
    Service->>Inngest: Emit event 'crawler/crawl.requested'
    API->>User: Return CrawlJob metadata (201 Created)
    
    Note over Inngest, DB: Background Processing
    Inngest->>Inngest: Run process_crawl_job
    Inngest->>Service: execute_sitemap_mapping()
    Service-->>Inngest: Discover URLs
    Inngest->>DB: Update pages_discovered
    
    loop Per Halaman (Iteratif / Rekursif)
        Inngest->>Service: fetch & scrape URL
        Service->>DB: Simpan ke crawled_pages & update pages_crawled
        Inngest->>Inngest: Rate-limiting delay (politeness)
    end
    Inngest->>DB: Mark CrawlJob 'COMPLETED'
```

